  "title": "Stratos 4",
  "justification": "AniDB special S1 \"Logbook\" (2006-08-25) is TVDB season 0 episode 4 \"Logbook\" (2006-08-26), not episode 5 \"Code 207 : Cross-Wind Take Off\", which is episode 1 of Stratos 4 Advance Kanketsuhen (AniDB 4419). S3 \"1st Priority Music Clip\", S4 \"Making Of\", S5 \"Melocure Promotion Video + Hinata Megumi Interview\" and S6 \"Round-Table Discussion\" had no row and fell on season 0 episodes 3-6, the OVA episodes of 1858 and 4419; TVDB lists no such extras, so they are unmapped. TMDB 34182 season 0 lists the same six episodes in the same order (Dutch Roll, Return To Base, Dispersion, Logbook, Code 207, Code 208), so the row names TMDB season 0 too.",
